    "\n",
    "Once our tables are registered in Zetaris, put their names below. The same question is asked both ways; the rows should match.\n",
    "`app.adapters.zetaris.Zetaris(sample_mode=True)` is exactly what the app uses today (DuckDB over `data/sample/`)."
   ]
